%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/array_test.clj:284 (zip-test)
testing: Zip two arrays
元の形: arrays/zip の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import zip from dw::core::Arrays
output application/json
---
zip([1, 2, 3], ["a", "b", "c"])
%%% output application/json
[
  [
    1,
    "a"
  ],
  [
    2,
    "b"
  ],
  [
    3,
    "c"
  ]
]
